      "zh": {
        "title": "印度航空今年調整17條直飛航線 多條改由印度快運接手",
        "summary": "航空媒體盤點印度航空2026年航網，發現17條航線停止由母公司執飛，其中多條仍由印度快運航空提供服務。",
        "body": [
          "Simple Flying 盤點指出，印度航空2026年停止自行執飛17條直飛航線。其中德里至伯明罕、維也納與哥本哈根分別於11月或10月停飛。",
          "部分航線仍留在集團航網。報導指出，印度快運航空接手了海德拉巴至杜拜、清奈至新加坡，以及孟買至哥印拜陀等航線。這17條航線反映全年調整。"
        ]
      },
      "en": {
        "title": "Air India dropped or handed off 17 nonstop routes in 2026, analysis finds",
        "summary": "Several routes that Air India stopped flying in 2026 continued under its subsidiary Air India Express.",
        "body": [
          "A Simple Flying review identified 17 nonstop routes that Air India stopped operating in 2026. Delhi services to Birmingham, Vienna and Copenhagen ended in October or November.",
          "Some routes remained in the wider group network. Air India Express took over services such as Hyderabad–Dubai, Chennai–Singapore and Mumbai–Coimbatore. The tally reflects changes across the year."
        ]
      },
